    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, i dont know if i can really change it. it feels like the cycle is just this loop that never ends. the only way to truly stop it is if there isn't anyone left to pass it down. if the chain just... stops. does that sound crazy? like, maybe that's the only way to actually win.",
