      "content": "it just feels so much more noble that way. like, if i stay, i just keep the cycle going and i'll eventually hurt people just like my family did. but if i'm the one who breaks it... if i'm the one who ends it here... then maybe the damage finally stops. it's like i'd be protecting everyone else by just not being part of the equation anymore. is that messed up to think?",
